---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy | Causewave" 
  description="Privacy policy for Causewave Innovations LLP."
  ogTitle="Privacy Policy | Causewave Innovations LLP"
  ogDescription="Privacy policy for Causewave Innovations LLP. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
  canonicalPath="privacy-policy/"
>
  <main>
    <section class="section max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: June 2026</p>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>
              When you contact us through our website forms, we collect the information you provide, including your name, email address, company name, and any message content. We also collect standard web analytics data including page views, referral sources, and browser information.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>
              We use the information you provide to respond to your inquiries, send relevant updates about our services (with your consent), and improve our website experience. We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">3. Data Security</h2>
            <p>
              We implement appropriate security measures to protect your personal information. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">4. Cookies</h2>
            <p>
              Our website uses essential cookies for basic functionality. We do not use tracking cookies or third-party advertising cookies.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">5. Your Rights</h2>
            <p>
              You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal information. To exercise these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:innovate@causewave.in" class="text-sky-600 hover:underline">innovate@causewave.in</a>.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">6. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
              For questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:innovate@causewave.in" class="text-sky-600 hover:underline">innovate@causewave.in</a>.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
